      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK Northwest is delighted to bring to the market this charming 4-bedroom family home. Accommodation comprises of 3 double bedrooms and 2 bathrooms on the main floor, with an open-plan family room & dining area. A new modern-style galley kitchen has been recently installed.\r\n\r\nThis property exudes character from the unique door framing to the exposed beams in the family room and onto the sliding doors leading to a covered veranda with an open fire onto the serene back gardens. The accommodation also includes a self-contained 1-bedroom apartment upstairs.\r\n\r\nWith all amenities on your doorstep in Claremorris plus the escape of a gated entrance and private gardens, this property is a rare find.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property has natural stone and wooden cladding, including a covered carport and side entrance into the property.\r\n\r\nThe property is located just minutes from Claremorris and the N17, so an ideal location for commuting. \r\n\r\nClaremorris community is vibrant with festivals and art exhibitions. There are local schools, walking parks and a leisure centre in the area; this is the perfect location for anyone with a young family close enough for convenience but appreciating countryside living.\r\n\r\nDouble-glazed windows throughout.\r\nMains Water\r\nSeptic Tank\r\nMains Electricity\r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised and strictly by appointment with the sole agent.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
